GIBBS FREE ENERGY
-------------------

The Gibbs free energy is G = H - T*S

Total enthalpy                    ...   -867.69839853 Eh 
Total entropy correction          ...     -0.05581261 Eh    -35.02 kcal/mol
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Final Gibbs free energy         ...   -867.75421114 Eh

For completeness - the Gibbs free energy minus the electronic energy
G-E(el)                           ...      0.18905565 Eh    118.63 kcal/mol



